{
  "spec": "docs/specs/004-playback-resolver",
  "task": "T032",
  "title": "播放兼容矩阵自制媒体/受控 HLS 样本清单(参数与预期形态;非产物清单)",
  "generator": "generate-media.mjs",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "hashPolicy": {
    "statement": "样本由 lavfi(testsrc/sine)+ 固定编码参数合成:同一 ffmpeg 版本下字节级确定;跨 ffmpeg 版本/构建不保证 sha256 相等。故 manifest.json 记录「生成参数确定性 + 预期 ffprobe 形态」;逐样本字节数/sha256/实测 probe 摘要写入生成时落在 outDir 的 manifest.instance.json(不入库,不提交)。",
    "instanceManifest": "manifest.instance.json(含 ffmpeg/ffprobe 版本、sourceManifestSha256=本文件字节 hash、逐样本 bytes/sha256/fingerprint)",
    "idempotency": "fingerprint(引擎版本+manifest 生成参数+派生父 hash)一致且文件 sha256 一致 → 跳过;hash 不同(ffmpeg 版本差异)→ 回退 ffprobe 形态比对,形态一致同样跳过;形态不符则重生成。派生(损坏)样本指纹含父样本 hash,父样本重生成必然连带重生成。",
    "verify": "生成后自动 ffprobe 复核逐样本形态;--verify-only 可独立复核;非法/损坏样本预期 probe 稳定失败。"
  },
  "security": "样本全部由本仓库脚本在本机用 ffmpeg 合成,无外部下载、无真实源凭据;生成产物默认输出 os.tmpdir 随机子目录,不入库不提交。",
  "planReference": "apps/server/src/modules/playback/playback-plan.service.ts 决策树(容器矩阵 mp4/mkv/avi/mov/ts;视频兼容=h264+8bit+yuv420p;音频兼容=aac/无轨;direct→remux→audio_transcode→video_transcode;4K/HDR 仅尽力直放,需重编码即稳定失败)。",
  "defaults": {
    "durationSeconds": 3,
    "resolution": "128x96",
    "frameRate": 10,
    "videoPattern": "lavfi testsrc",
    "audioPattern": "lavfi sine frequency=440(单声道 44100Hz)",
    "audioBitrateNote": "AAC 32k;AC-3/E-AC-3 64k;DTS 用 dca 编码器 192k(dca 为实验性编码器需 -strict -2;128k 对单声道非法,缺省码率过大)",
    "sizeNote": "除 4K 样本(3840x2160,veryfast+crf30,实测约 0.1MB)外全部 ≤0.1MB 量级"
  },
  "matrixNotes": [
    "任务原拟 avi/mpeg4+mp3:mp3 不在 FR-014/plan 音频合法集 {aac,ac3,eac3,dts},plan 层会判「非法组合」而非 video_transcode;按 spec 矩阵调整为 avi/mpeg4+ac3(AC-3 在 AVI 为经典合法组合),仍落在 video_transcode 路径。",
    "hevc×avi 为 FR-014 非法组合,不生成真实文件(plan 层拒绝,由单测覆盖);此处「非法」样本为非媒体伪装与损坏截断两类。",
    "mov 与 mp4 共用 ffmpeg mov 族 demuxer(format_name 同为 mov,mp4,…),media-probe 归一化按别名气序将两者映射为 mp4;mov 样本的路径判定由 hevc 编码驱动,与容器归一化无关。",
    "损坏样本采用「截去头部 1024 字节」:基线 mp4 为 +faststart(moov 在头部),截去头部必然破坏 box 结构使 ffprobe 稳定失败;尾部截断的 faststart mp4 仍可被 demuxer 解析,不宜作损坏夹具。",
    "HDR 样本颜色元数据经 -x265-params colorprim/transfer/colormatrix 写入 VUI(ffmpeg -color_* 选项对 libx265 不落地),ffprobe 可读 color_transfer=smpte2084/color_primaries=bt2020。",
    "实测(ffmpeg 8.1.1):mp4/ts/mov/avi/HLS 及派生损坏样本同机跨目录字节确定;MKV 因 Matroska muxer 写入随机 SegmentUID,每次生成 sha256 必不同——故幂等跳过的权威判据是 fingerprint+probe 形态,hash 仅作同目录快路径。"
  ],
  "coverage": {
    "containers": {
      "mp4": ["mp4-h264-aac-direct", "mp4-h264-ac3-atranscode", "mp4-h264-eac3-atranscode", "mp4-h264-aac-4k-besteffort", "mp4-hevc10-aac-hdr-besteffort", "illegal-fake-mp4", "corrupt-truncated-mp4"],
      "mkv": ["mkv-h264-aac-remux", "mkv-hevc10-aac-vtranscode", "mkv-h264-dts-atranscode"],
      "ts": ["ts-h264-aac-remux"],
      "mov": ["mov-hevc8-aac-vtranscode"],
      "avi": ["avi-mpeg4-ac3-vtranscode"]
    },
    "videoCodecs": {
      "h264-8bit-yuv420p": ["mp4-h264-aac-direct", "mkv-h264-aac-remux", "ts-h264-aac-remux", "mp4-h264-ac3-atranscode", "mkv-h264-dts-atranscode", "mp4-h264-eac3-atranscode", "mp4-h264-aac-4k-besteffort"],
      "hevc-8bit": ["mov-hevc8-aac-vtranscode"],
      "hevc-10bit-main10": ["mkv-hevc10-aac-vtranscode", "mp4-hevc10-aac-hdr-besteffort"],
      "mpeg4-part2": ["avi-mpeg4-ac3-vtranscode"]
    },
    "audioCodecs": {
      "aac": ["mp4-h264-aac-direct", "mkv-h264-aac-remux", "ts-h264-aac-remux", "mov-hevc8-aac-vtranscode", "mkv-hevc10-aac-vtranscode", "mp4-h264-aac-4k-besteffort", "mp4-hevc10-aac-hdr-besteffort"],
      "ac3": ["avi-mpeg4-ac3-vtranscode", "mp4-h264-ac3-atranscode"],
      "eac3": ["mp4-h264-eac3-atranscode"],
      "dts": ["mkv-h264-dts-atranscode"]
    },
    "paths": {
      "direct": ["mp4-h264-aac-direct", "mp4-h264-aac-4k-besteffort"],
      "remux": ["mkv-h264-aac-remux", "ts-h264-aac-remux"],
      "audio_transcode": ["mp4-h264-ac3-atranscode", "mkv-h264-dts-atranscode", "mp4-h264-eac3-atranscode"],
      "video_transcode": ["mov-hevc8-aac-vtranscode", "avi-mpeg4-ac3-vtranscode", "mkv-hevc10-aac-vtranscode"],
      "unsupported(4K/HDR 尽力直放边界)": ["mp4-hevc10-aac-hdr-besteffort"],
      "illegal": ["illegal-fake-mp4", "corrupt-truncated-mp4"],
      "hls": ["hls-h264-aac-vod"]
    }
  },
  "samples": [
